# Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard Using Python

## 📊 Project Overview

Sales & Revenue Analysis Dashboard is an interactive data analytics project developed using Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, and Streamlit.

The project analyzes sales data to identify revenue trends, top-performing products, category-wise performance, regional sales, customer contribution, and payment method patterns.

An interactive Streamlit dashboard presents key performance indicators, visualizations, filters, and downloadable data for easy business analysis.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Analyze overall sales and revenue performance
- Identify top-performing products and customers
- Analyze category-wise and region-wise revenue
- Understand payment method distribution
- Track monthly revenue trends
- Present insights through an interactive dashboard

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Streamlit

## 📌 Dashboard Features

- Total Revenue
- Total Orders
- Total Customers
- Quantity Sold
- Average Order Value
- Monthly Revenue Trend
- Revenue by Category
- Top 5 Products
- Revenue by Region
- Payment Method Distribution
- Top 10 Customers
- Quantity Sold vs Revenue
- Interactive filters
- Downloadable filtered data

